  message: "From WI-movur's second tranche (audit 0029): (1) the aiohttp route row `add_get` / `add_post` / `add_put` / `add_delete` / `add_patch` now HAS a producer (py.py registration contexts; path from the first argument, method from the call name; fixture-tested), which serves audit 0028's A1 and A3; `add_route`, `add_view`, `add_static` and `web.get(...)` inside `add_routes` are still not recorded. (2) tornado `URLSpec(r\"/y\", H)` is fed the same way. (3) Vapor `use:` handlers (0028 V2, V3) now get their dispatches_to (the handler is put on the route marker). (4) Still nothing for Scala and Kotlin: neither analyzer emits usage contexts, and the non-route akka-http, Play and Ktor forms of audit 0029 (jvm K10-K12, K18-K20, K23, K24, T8, T9, T15-T19, T23, P5-P7) wait on the same mechanism as the route forms here. (5) PHP: the Slim registration calls (`$app->add`, `setErrorHandler` ...) need the same `$app->` extractor as the Slim routes (S1); php.py also emits no edge for a file-scope call. Cross-link only."  # 1738
